  note "== Krol'dok Stronghold (new Forever dungeon) == The Riverglades is a new zone, so there are no map-arrow coordinates yet. Go north of the Swamp of Sorrows (north of Stonard) into the Riverglades and find the Horde base Rog'mar and its flight path. If the way is blocked, take the boat from Steamwheedle Port (east Tanaris) to Powderfuse Port."
  note "* Krol'dok Stronghold — about Lv42.5 -> about Lv43.5 · recommended Lv40-45 (healer 40 · tank/DPS 41) · new Forever dungeon"

